{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3329, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3152, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3334, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1bcf0b2f147f1d4f0b2f0a8f0b881432f2ff14f8145f4dd8145f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "둘이서만이라니，//기・뻐・요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "二人きりなんて、//う・れ・し・い・わぁ～。", "pointer_offset": 3156, "unit": "dialogue:3ad03dfdc83137a9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 4024, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf0a8f16881608144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패라구～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//アタシのパイが//ボーナスパイなのよ～ん。", "pointer_offset": 3160, "unit": "dialogue:31759e6b4077a182", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3434, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f1c8f148816081442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1f3c1f2658144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이거야～．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれよ～。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてねぇ。", "pointer_offset": 3164, "unit": "dialogue:ed94916ce0009b2a", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 4067, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0aff3d081b82f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f8d3f1c8f0f0816081b8", "baseline_text": "아앙∈//내가 딜러인 거네～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あぁん！//アタシが親なのねぇ∈", "pointer_offset": 3168, "unit": "dialogue:aa363ed8c71de5d5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 4094, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff0b2f1d9f0a3f944f5f3f0c7f14881b82f2ff484f19cf0a8f168816081b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//이치로가 딜러야∈//힘내라구～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//一郎ちゃんが親よぉ！//がんばってねぇん∈", "pointer_offset": 3172, "unit": "dialogue:d50be7e5af6770be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3579, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f19cf944f0b2fac6f26cf35df0f081b82f2ff14ff4a3f0b8f261f7d12f2ff56af56af94bf285f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "내가 이겨 버렸네∈//기쁘니까…//뽀뽀해 줄게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アタシ勝っちゃったのね！//うれしいから……//チュウしてあげる∈", "pointer_offset": 3176, "unit": "dialogue:580fec9fa2c88eea", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3642, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0e2f165f0ccf15af7d12f2ff0b2f0df8143f8b1f1d4f344f94bf26cf35df15af7d1", "baseline_text": "대단했어…//이제，나 만족해 버렸어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すごかったわ……//もう、アタシ満足しちゃった……", "pointer_offset": 3180, "unit": "dialogue:b30e36f35857acdd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3691, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f7d12f2ff0a6f345f0a5f8a4f287f0aff8f4f25df157f18d81b8", "baseline_text": "정말…//사양하지 않아도 됐는데∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "んもう……//遠慮しなくてもよかったのに！", "pointer_offset": 3184, "unit": "dialogue:01d796f63f030fd4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3732, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3188, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT22YUKI.SBN", "offset": 3755, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3192, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
